ON UPDATE/DELETE SET NULL computed an indexed virtual column from the parent
row instead of the child's cascade update vector; the index got a wrong
value and the cascade hit ut_a(!cursor->index->is_committed())
(Bug#37478594). Percona's 5.7 port without the prebuilt argument of its
compressed columns.
https://github.com/percona/percona-server/commit/ecfdc636ef
https://github.com/mysql/mysql-server/commit/fc4b73f4002

